      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent on a Loss Bowl: Learning Rate and Batch Size\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface shows the loss for two model settings, x across the screen (steep) and z toward you (gentle). The lowest point is a dark dot in the centre. A red ball starts on the slope. Each step moves it by learning rate times a noisy mini-batch slope estimate. An orange trail marks each landing point. A purple arrow shows the next mini-batch step and a dark arrow shows the full-data step. A faded blue ghost can keep the previous run. Readouts show steps, loss, step length and status.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlBlue\",\"color\":\"#8aa4c8\"},{\"id\":\"ballRed\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"pathOrange\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"ghostBlue\",\"color\":\"#1f3a7a\"},{\"id\":\"stepPurple\",\"color\":\"#7b2fbf\"},{\"id\":\"fullDark\",\"color\":\"#2f3640\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlGrid\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[2.4,2.08,1.79,1.53,1.3,1.09,0.92,0.77,0.66,0.57,0.51,0.48,0.48,0.51,0.57,0.66,0.77,0.92,1.09,1.3,1.53,1.79,2.08,2.4],[2.32,2,1.71,1.45,1.22,1.01,0.84,0.69,0.58,0.49,0.43,0.4,0.4,0.43,0.49,0.58,0.69,0.84,1.01,1.22,1.45,1.71,2,2.32],[2.25,1.93,1.64,1.38,1.15,0.94,0.77,0.62,0.51,0.42,0.36,0.33,0.33,0.36,0.42,0.51,0.62,0.77,0.94,1.15,1.38,1.64,1.93,2.25],[2.18,1.86,1.57,1.31,1.08,0.87,0.7,0.55,0.44,0.35,0.29,0.26,0.26,0.29,0.35,0.44,0.55,0.7,0.87,1.08,1.31,1.57,1.86,2.18],[2.12,1.8,1.51,1.25,1.02,0.81,0.64,0.49,0.38,0.29,0.23,0.2,0.2,0.23,0.29,0.38,0.49,0.64,0.81,1.02,1.25,1.51,1.8,2.12],[2.07,1.75,1.46,1.2,0.97,0.76,0.59,0.44,0.33,0.24,0.18,0.15,0.15,0.18,0.24,0.33,0.44,0.59,0.76,0.97,1.2,1.46,1.75,2.07],[2.03,1.71,1.42,1.16,0.93,0.72,0.55,0.4,0.29,0.2,0.14,0.11,0.11,0.14,0.2,0.29,0.4,0.55,0.72,0.93,1.16,1.42,1.71,2.03],[